==English==
===Etymology===
Coined by {{w|Ferdinand von Richthofen}} as {{etyl|de}} {{term|Rhyolith}}, from {{etyl|grc}} {{term|ῥέω||flow|tr=rheō}} + {{term|-lith|lang=de}} (modified to {{term|-lite|lang=en}}).

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{geology}} An [[igneous]], [[volcanic]] ([[extrusive]]) [[rock]], of [[felsic]] [[composition]], with [[aphanitic]] to [[porphyritic]] texture.

